\begin{proposition}
Population mean $m=E(Y_1)$ and disagreement rate $d=P(Y_1\ne Y_2)$ identify $\epsilon$ and $p$ in this model:
\[
\epsilon=\frac{1-\sqrt{1-2d}}2,\qquad p=\frac{m-\epsilon}{1-2\epsilon}.
\]
